      "refersTo": "button-control",
      "description": "Labeled mic privacy control independent of scoring eligibility; ds-muted represents deliberate mic-off.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-control\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v7a3 3 0 0 1-6 0V5ZM5 10v2a7 7 0 0 0 14 0v-2M12 19v3M8 22h8\"/></svg><span>Mic on</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-control{font-family:var(--font-body,\"Nunito Sans\",sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 14px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-raised, #2F3F5C);color:var(--text-primary, #F6F8FF);font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;transition:background var(--quick,160ms),transform var(--quick,160ms) var(--ease,cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),box-shadow var(--quick,160ms);}.ds-control svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:0 0 auto}.ds-control:not(:disabled):hover{background:var(--surface-hover, #3B4E6B)}.ds-control:active{transform:translateY(2px)}.ds-control:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--border-focus, #F6F8FF);outline-offset:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--border-focus-gap, #151E32) !important;}.ds-control:disabled{color:var(--status-disabled-text, #B5C2D8);cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-control{flex-direction:column;gap:3px;padding:6px 4px;font-size:12px}.ds-control svg{width:16px;height:16px}}.ds-control.ds-muted{color:var(--status-privacy-text, #BFCBE0);background:var(--status-privacy-surface, #19263D)}"
